            "description_html": "<b>Acorn AJ4BQ, Semi-Concealed Self Closing Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nUsing a self closing hinge allows the cabinet door to swing closed by itself once you let go. Traditionally two or 3 of these will be used per door, depending on its size and weight. The Acorn made Self-Closing Cabinet Hinge can also eliminate the need for a clasp or hook to keep the door closed, allowing for a smooth, hands free appearance.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Self-Closing Smooth Iron Cabinet Hinges:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Smooth Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Height: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Flush Hinge -- Door face sits Flush with the door frame.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p> \r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Priced and sold as a pair (2-hinges)</i>\r\n</p>",
